<%- include('../partials/head') %><%- include('../partials/shell') %><section class="match-page"><span class="eyebrow">LET’S FIND YOUR PEOPLE</span><div class="match-symbol"><%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'spark'}) %></div><h1>Less searching.<br><em>More speaking.</em></h1><p>Tell us where you’d like to start.<br>We’ll find a helper with an open practice offer.</p><form id="match-form" class="panel stack"><label>I want to practice<select name="language"><% for(const l of languages){ %><option <%= l===user.languagesLearning[0]?.language?'selected':'' %>><%= l %></option><% } %></select></label><label>At this level<select name="level"><% for(const l of levels){ %><option><%= l %></option><% } %></select></label><label>When works for you?<select name="available"><option value="">Now or an upcoming time</option><option value="now">Available now</option></select></label><button class="btn dark">Find my match <%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'arrow'}) %></button><small>We match by language, practice level, and open offers. You’ll review the profile before requesting.</small></form><a class="text-link" href="/helpers">I’d rather browse helpers →</a></section><%- include('../partials/end',{shell:true}) %>
